{
    "title": "Domino Duel - Online Dominoes",
    "description": "Let\u2019s play Domino Duel! Have you played dominoes before phones existed? Well, now you can play it on your mobile device whenever you want, against players from all over the world!\r\n\r\nThe game's user interface is intuitive and easy to use, with clear instructions and helpful hints to guide you through the game. The graphics are bright and colorful, making the game a delight to look at, and the sound effects and background music add to the overall enjoyment of the game.\r\n\r\nRules & Modes \r\nThere are 3 main modes with ascending skill: \r\n\r\n1. <b>Draw</b> \r\nPlayers start with 5 tiles in partner games, and 7 in solo games. If players are blocked, they can draw from the boneyard. The game ends when one player finishes their tiles, or all players are blocked. \r\n\r\n2. <b>Block</b> \r\nAll players start with 7 tiles and there is no boneyard. If players are blocked, they have to pass. The player who finishes their tiles first wins, or the game ends when all players are blocked. \r\n\r\n3. <b>All Five</b> \r\nThis one is a bit more complicated, but once you get the hang of it, you\u2019ll play like a pro. Players start with 5 tiles in partner games, and 7 in solo games. If players are blocked, they can draw from the boneyard. If the sum of the pips of the end times equals a number dividable by 5, then that number is added to the player\u2019s points. \r\n\r\nAttention, highly competitive players! \r\nDomino Duel has a global leaderboard ranking that tracks the top players from around the world. You can see how you stack up against other players at any time, and strive to climb the ranks.\r\n\r\nThe rankings are based on skill level, the number of matches you've won, and the number of points you've scored. You can track your progress, compare yourself with your biggest rivals, and work to improve your game. Dominate the rankings in Domino Duel and prove you are a true dominos master! \r\n\r\nBonuses \r\nDo you like receiving coins for free? Every day, each player gets a daily bonus upon logging in. If you log in every day of the week, you'll earn an even bigger bonus. In addition to daily bonuses, Domino Duel also offers a range of missions and daily challenges to help you earn rewards and progress through the game. And of course, winning multiplayer matches would reward you with that satisfying jingle of the coins. \r\n\r\nPiggy bank\r\nCoins will accumulate into a Piggy bank the player can purchase from the menu. The Piggy bank will transition into a cooldown state after purchase or reset. Then a new Piggy bank will become available 24 hours later, starting a new coin accumulating process.\r\n\r\nEnjoy an exclusive bonus with Purchase stamps, where you will receive additional chips after 5 in-app purchases at any price (one stamp is a present from us). Also, additional bonuses with manual level up.\r\n\r\nDuel\r\nWith the Duel feature, players can take control and challenge opponents of their choice rather than relying on the algorithm's selection. A simple press of the DUEL button initiates a one-on-one showdown. \r\n\r\nRematch!\r\nIf the game did not go the way you wanted, you could always demand a Rematch with your last opponent.\r\n\r\nOnline Tournaments\r\nCompete against the most skilled dominoe players from across the globe. Win matches against the toughest opponents and at the end of the Tournament, your face could be among the biggest winners in the Tournament leaderboard!\r\n\r\nBecome a VIP\r\nVIP membership lasts for 30 days and offers several perks, including:\r\n\u2022 the removal of in-game ads;\r\n\u2022 access to exclusive galleries;\r\n\u2022 distinctive profile frame;\r\n\u2022 private chats with other players;\r\n\r\nTraining mode\r\nWith the training mode, players can compete against a capable AI. Every new player can hone their domino skill before going against read people in the multiplayer mode.\r\n\r\nChat & Social\r\nA player may like, befriend, and block other players, open direct messages and manage their chat. Deleting messages and entire conversations is also an option.\r\n\r\nSo, download Domino Duel today, create a profile, and start playing domino on the go!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Let\u2019s play Domino Duel! Have you played dominoes before phones existed? Well, now you can play it on your mobile device whenever you want, against players from all over the world!<br><br>The game&#39;s user interface is intuitive and easy to use, with clear instructions and helpful hints to guide you through the game. The graphics are bright and colorful, making the game a delight to look at, and the sound effects and background music add to the overall enjoyment of the game.<br><br>Rules &amp; Modes <br>There are 3 main modes with ascending skill: <br><br>1. <b>Draw</b> <br>Players start with 5 tiles in partner games, and 7 in solo games. If players are blocked, they can draw from the boneyard. The game ends when one player finishes their tiles, or all players are blocked. <br><br>2. <b>Block</b> <br>All players start with 7 tiles and there is no boneyard. If players are blocked, they have to pass. The player who finishes their tiles first wins, or the game ends when all players are blocked. <br><br>3. <b>All Five</b> <br>This one is a bit more complicated, but once you get the hang of it, you\u2019ll play like a pro. Players start with 5 tiles in partner games, and 7 in solo games. If players are blocked, they can draw from the boneyard. If the sum of the pips of the end times equals a number dividable by 5, then that number is added to the player\u2019s points. <br><br>Attention, highly competitive players! <br>Domino Duel has a global leaderboard ranking that tracks the top players from around the world. You can see how you stack up against other players at any time, and strive to climb the ranks.<br><br>The rankings are based on skill level, the number of matches you&#39;ve won, and the number of points you&#39;ve scored. You can track your progress, compare yourself with your biggest rivals, and work to improve your game. Dominate the rankings in Domino Duel and prove you are a true dominos master! <br><br>Bonuses <br>Do you like receiving coins for free? Every day, each player gets a daily bonus upon logging in. If you log in every day of the week, you&#39;ll earn an even bigger bonus. In addition to daily bonuses, Domino Duel also offers a range of missions and daily challenges to help you earn rewards and progress through the game. And of course, winning multiplayer matches would reward you with that satisfying jingle of the coins. <br><br>Piggy bank<br>Coins will accumulate into a Piggy bank the player can purchase from the menu. The Piggy bank will transition into a cooldown state after purchase or reset. Then a new Piggy bank will become available 24 hours later, starting a new coin accumulating process.<br><br>Enjoy an exclusive bonus with Purchase stamps, where you will receive additional chips after 5 in-app purchases at any price (one stamp is a present from us). Also, additional bonuses with manual level up.<br><br>Duel<br>With the Duel feature, players can take control and challenge opponents of their choice rather than relying on the algorithm&#39;s selection. A simple press of the DUEL button initiates a one-on-one showdown. <br><br>Rematch!<br>If the game did not go the way you wanted, you could always demand a Rematch with your last opponent.<br><br>Online Tournaments<br>Compete against the most skilled dominoe players from across the globe. Win matches against the toughest opponents and at the end of the Tournament, your face could be among the biggest winners in the Tournament leaderboard!<br><br>Become a VIP<br>VIP membership lasts for 30 days and offers several perks, including:<br>\u2022 the removal of in-game ads;<br>\u2022 access to exclusive galleries;<br>\u2022 distinctive profile frame;<br>\u2022 private chats with other players;<br><br>Training mode<br>With the training mode, players can compete against a capable AI. Every new player can hone their domino skill before going against read people in the multiplayer mode.<br><br>Chat &amp; Social<br>A player may like, befriend, and block other players, open direct messages and manage their chat. Deleting messages and entire conversations is also an option.<br><br>So, download Domino Duel today, create a profile, and start playing domino on the go!",
